<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 977 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 977 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 977 million zlotys worth of the National Bank of Poland's 182-day and 273-day bills at today's tender against a combined one bilion zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>It said banks bid for 244 million zlotys of the 182-day paper and 733 million zlotys of the 273-day bills.</p>
<p>Full details of the tender will be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
